ENG:
You borrow [SCOPE.ScriptValue('holy_order_gold_value')|P00] [gold|E][gold_i] from a [holy_order|E]

@warning_icon! The [holy_order|E] will start making demands if you do not repay the loan
@warning_icon! You cannot borrow more money again until you have paid back this loan

RUS:
[holy_order|E] одолжит вам [SCOPE.ScriptValue('holy_order_gold_value')|P00] [Concept( 'gold', 'золота' )|E] [gold_i]

@warning_icon! [holy_order|E] станет выдвигать требования, если вы не выплатите долг
